<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Colossia</para>
  <para style="toc1">COLOSSIA Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colossia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col</para>
  <para style="mt1">COLOSSIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Colossia koisuok diang chemajia hi tirton Paul imajia eii (Col. 1:1)</char> Hiwa Colossia koisuok diangnga chemajia hi Christa inneisuo kum soomruk thengnga Paul in Rome mikhumna suungnga omlai khanna mikhumna makheiya imajia eii. Colossia, Ephesia khat-um Philemon hiwa larik inthumhi mikhumna larik tia injetna ajarchu Paul in mikhumna makheiya imajia larik ejarra eii. Hiwa larik hi Colossia khuopuiya kaom koisuok diang Paul in imajia eii. Colossia koisuok hi Paul apum tak-in iphun emak tia aril (2:1), takkha ma-um arei om tiya ngaidon, Colossia koisuok hi Epaphras iphun ete tia inlei ajarchu Epaphras hi Colossae makheiya eii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Colossia koisuok suungnga akadikmak ocha lekkhat inom jarra Paul in amalung poongna anei. Hiwa ngai jarra larik hin Paul in katam khat pha aleiya tam amajia. Colossia koisuok suungnga Jihudi Christian rahooi ngai'n Inzootna Maruo (OT) suungnga injia Jihudi ngai sinadan kha Christian leiilaak ngaidiang juimak chamak intiya inminchu, sinadan ngai karra aru etheiya wuntan jarra hi eii. Paul in Christian eini chu Pathian izoot mi enasik Christa elekleiya tuteii um emakli eteii nijuisik arei ommak tiya imajia eii (Col 1:15-20). Paul in manmasi ngai ngaidon dungjuiya minchuna ngaihi nemna kaboi eii tiya amajia (Col 2:8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul in Colossia koisuok diang donnachong ma minsa-ah phutna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:1">1:1</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:2">2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Hiwa thengli akadikmak ocha ngai rakook-ah Christa lokna jarra Paul in amajia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:3-3:4">1:3–3:4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Paul larik rakip ah imajia angnga minchu mindikna khat-um akatha Christian ringkhuo khan inring chaknasik jarra hiwa larik heksiktiang amajia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 3:5-4:6">3:5–4:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paul in chemajia larik hi Colossia khat-um leiilaak koisuok ngaikhan inringnga teelru tiya minpaak nale inruoiya minhekna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Paul, Pathian lungdou nuoiya Christa Jisu tirton ka-eii, khat-um einile unai ka-eii Timothy in—<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Colossae ah kaom Pathian mi ngai khat-um Christa diang ngamna kaom ule nai ngaidiang:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Pa Pathian riangwai khat-um kadai kha nangni chungnga omrase.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Minpaaknale Nina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Keini'n nangni sik-ah Pathian kinni phakhan, eini Pumi Jisu Christa Pa Pathian kha inchatlekleiya kinminpaak. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Ajarchu Christa Jisu diang ningngamna khat-um Pathian ka-ngamna miring rakip diang ningminriang kha keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Nangni sik-ah marwaanna kaomjei ngamna jarra, hiwa ngamna hi matiang akadik chongkhan ningleijetjei. Chongkahoi kha nangnidiang aheitungjei. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Nangni'n Pathian riangwai kha ningjet khat-um inthiangnga ningkeiluut niya inphut nangni karra akasuok kha angnga hiwa Pathian chonghi manmasituol pumpuiya inthangnga akarajei.<verse eid="COL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Minriang kaom keini suok inchangpui, keini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">keini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nangni tia injia.</char></note> rathuulla Christa sik-ah ngamna kaom chuonkatho Epaphras diangnga inphut nangni'n Pathian riangwai kha ning-inchujei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Col 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Philem 23</ref></char><verse eid="COL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />halli ama'n Ratha-ah ning-inriang kha keinidiang anarilpi.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Hiwa jarra, keini'n nangni jarra kinjetniya inphut, keini'n nangni sik-ah Pathian kani inchatmung. Ratha inapeii lungsing lungwar khat-um jetna theina rakip khan Pathian lungdou kha nangnidiang siprase kintia Pathian diang kinni. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Pathian lungdou katho, Pumi diang ringkhuo kalurra ningomnasik-ah, katha chong rakip-ah akakara, Pathian singna theina-ah insoon ning-enasik Pathian diang kinni. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Ama lurna lianna ranak dungjuiya, kadei karaat, khat-um kadei kangar emator nasik-ah ranak rakip-ah nangni namin-ngar rase, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />halli karok-ah inthiang Pathian sangai omnamun war rengram khan nangni-um karei kachangsik-ah rahoi kanamin-eii tum kanapeii Pa Pathian kha minpaakru. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Ama'n akaziing ranak diangnga inphut eini kha anakatan halli iminriang Asapa rengramma anaheiruoi, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />amadiang eini manu ngai ngaidamna, nakatanna kha nimu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Eph 1:7</ref></char><verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa khat-um Ama Chuontho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Christa hi nimumak Pathian ramil kha eii, kutbool rakip karra salutir kha eii; <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />ajarchu angrakip ngaihi ama diangnga inphut Pathian ibool eii, marwaanna halli nuoipilla, nimu khat-um nimumak, lairalak-ah rengmun ngai emakli ranak ngai, reng ngai emakli waikaroon ngai; ang rakip ngaihi ama sik-ah Pathian in ibool eii. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Angrakip ngai matiang Christa injirjei, halli ama diangnga inphut angrakip injir.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Christa hi koisuok lu kha eii halli koisuok hi ama taksa kha eii, kathi ngai karra karingmasa salutir kha ama eii, ajarchu angrakip chungnga chungkanung khet kha a-enasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 1:22">Eph 1:22</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:23">23</ref></char><verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Ajarchu Pathian sipna kha Christa diang omsik hi Pathian lungdou alei eii,<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />halli ama diangnga inphut nuoipilla khat-um marwaanna kaom phur rakip ngaikha cross-ah kasar ama thisen khan inngeina khat-um kadai kha aheichoi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Eph 2:16</ref></char><verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Apha khat-ah nangni um Pathian diang leiommakchu halli kathamak chuon ningtho khat-um ningngaidon jarra Pathian le inhalmi ninglei eii. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Takkha tuunchu ama'n taksa ah ithi khan inzootna aheichoijei, khawa khachu nangni kha inthiang, kachok omlekleiya khat-um noonkuung pesik omleiya ama omnakhan anamin-ngir nasik eii. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ningjetjei Pathian chong-inthiang makheiya ngamna leiilaak thuulmaru, ngamna cheiru, kacheet-ah ngirru, marwaan nuoiya kaom miring rakipdiang inriljei, halli hiwa chongkahoi sik-ah Paul kei-um suok kha ka eii.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koisuok sik-ah Paul Chuontho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Tuunchu nangni sik-ah kipoong kha kei'n karok, Christa in taksa ah koisuok sik-ah poongna ileidei insam ngaikha mintungnasik kei'n taksa ah kipoong hi'n insam ngaikha kamintungjei. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Pathian natirna nuoiya nangni diang rilro tia inapeii, Pathian chong kha huui katungnga karilsik-ah kei suok kha ka eii, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />kum khat-um khang angjet-ah inthup-ah kaleiom, takkha tuunchu inthiang Pathian mi ngaidiang amalarjei. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Pathian ama lungdou chu inphuumma kaom ama chong kha ikadang ama mi ngaidiang minjetsik hi eii. Hiwa inphuumma kaom lurna hi zaatlop ngai karra angtuk kalokme, khachu Christa in nangni diang om, khawa tinachu nangni'n Pathian lurna khan tum ningchangsik eii. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Christa kha keini'n miring rakipdiang kinrilthang, lungsing lungwar rakip-ah miring rakip diang kinminchu khat-um chong kinthak, ajarchu miring rakip Christa maikuungnga puikatung mi eya keini'n kinpenasik eii. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Hiwa chuonhi huui tungnasik, Christa inapeii ratha raatna, kasuungnga chuonkatho kha kaneimanna kapoong karaal kadei.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nangni khat-um Laodicea ah kaom inmani ngai, halli kei kanalamumak mi rakip sik-ah angtuk kapoong karaalla chuon katho itihi nangni'n ningjet kha kei'n kamanuom. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Kei'n hiwa kathona ajarchu inmani ngai'n inmalungnga insoknasik khat-um inriangnga inchunnasik eii, tichu inmani'n katha-ah angrakip injetnasik halli inmani'n Pathian inthuuk kha injetnasik eii, khachu, Christa apumtak kha eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian inthuukna, Christa apumtak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian inthuukna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leiilaak in </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Christa pa Pathian inthuukna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lekkhat ngai'n </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian halli Pa khat-um Christa inthuukna tia injia.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Amadiang Pathian lungsing lungwar khat-um singna theina rakip ngaikha inphuumma om.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Tuteii innum inmani kha akatha in-ang innum, maleisei chongnga nangni kha lamleiitiang naroimaknasik, kei'n hiwahi nangni diang kanati. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Khachu kei'n kataksa ah nangni makheiya ka-inlaak innum, kei nangnile ratha-ah kaom, Christa diang kacheet-ah ningom halli nangni ngamna kha kamu sik ah kei'n karok.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa diang Ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Christa Jisu kha Pumi ejei tia ningngamnajei keengnga, amadiang inchatlekleiya omru. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Ningrajung kha ama diang mincheetru halli amadiang moongru, nangni naminchu kha angnga ngamna khan ngir mincheetru, halli kaminpaak khan sipru.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Christa dungjuiya ka-emak, miringngai sinadan dungjuiya, manmasituol waikaroon ratha ngai dungjuiya, tuteii innum nangni kha akadongkok manmasi lungsing lungwar khan suok naminchang marasu. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ajarchu Pathian sipnakha taksa-ah Christa diang om, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />halli nangni diang-um akasip ringna kha Christa diang napejei. Ama hi ranak khat-um waikaroon rakip lu kha-eii.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Amadiang miring kut-ah intan wuntan ka-emak-ah wun ningtan kha ejei. Christa in wun natan nakhan nangni'n manu taksa kha ningmathaan kha ejei.<verse eid="COL 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Ajarchu baptize ningtho phakhan, nangni Christa le ningthi kha ejei, halli baptism khan akathi makheiya Christa kha kaminring nangni ngamna Pathian ranak khan nangni-um Christa le ningring kha ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref></char><verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Nangni um apha khatchu ningmanu khat-um sinadan kaommak zaatlop ning-eii jarra ratha lamma akathi kha ninglei-eii. Takkha Pathian khan nangni kha Christa le inruoiya naminring. Pathian in eini manu rakip ngaikha ngaidamjei; <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Eph 2:1-5</ref></char><verse eid="COL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Ama'n eini manu leithona chungnga lei-injia khat-um juimak kathamak sinadan injia ngaikha ama'n cross chungnga nakhaipi wiakjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Eph 2:15</ref></char><verse eid="COL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Waikaroon ngai khat-um kathomator ngai ranak kha akasut-ah ama'n mirakip musik-ah inmani ngaikha cross chungnga minjakna apeya amatorjei.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Khantia tuteii inkhat in bak jarra emakli in jarra emakli kahoi emakli Thade kahoi emakli Sabbath nikhuo jarra nangnidiang chong tanmarasu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14:1-6</ref></char><verse eid="COL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Hiwa ngaihi alakahongsik ngai raliim kha eii; takkha ka-etak khachu Christa kha eii. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kadikmak nunchan inchuol khat-um marwaan tirton ngai chubei katho tuteii inkhat innum nangni chungnga chongtansik rahoi min-ommarasu, khawa ka-ang mi khan inmu-ngai jarra kaseiya inril, takkha iteii arei omlekleiya khawa ka-ang mi khan inmani manmasi i-ngaidon lamma in-or<verse eid="COL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />halli inmani ngaikha alu ka-eii Christa khale injommujei. Christa in taksa pumpui kha ru-zaang mindon khat-um minjom, halli taksa kha Pathian imanuom dungjuiya insoon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Eph 4:16</ref></char><verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa le Thina khat-um Ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Nangni'n Christa le hiwa manmasituol waikaroon ratha ngai diangnga inphut ningthijei keengnga, angjarra halle nangni'n hiwa manmasituol mi ning-angnga ninglaring titme? Angjarra khawa sinadan ngaikha ninglajuime, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Mahuum khaimaru,” “Mintem khaimaru,” “Katook khaimaru” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Hiwa ngai rakip ni-inliingna-ah kamangsik eii, ajarchu hiwa rakip ngaihi manmasi chongpeii khat-um minchuna kha in-eii. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Khawa juisikdan ngaikha inlungdouwa inminsuuk chubei eii, akadikmak nunchan inchuol khat-um inpum kha intheinuo-ah karachaak lungsing lungwar eii; intaksa manuom insurna khan iteii innemna ommak.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Christa le inruoiya nangni naminringjei keengnga, chungtiangnga kaom phurngai kha ningmalungnga entokru, khawakhan Christa in Pathian kutchangtiang in-ong. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Chungtiangnga kaom phurngai sik-ah ningmalungnga ngaidonru, nuoipilchungnga kaom phurngai sik-ah ngaidonmaru. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ajarchu nangni ningthijei, halli nangni ringkhuo kha Christa le Pathian diang om. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Nangni ringkhuo ka-eii, Christa juo-inlar phakhan, nangni um lurna lianna khan amale ning-inlarsik eii.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaruo khat-um Akathar Ringkhuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Zool-inthai, inthiangmak, taksa imanuom, akathamak nimanuom khat-um kara-ot, ramil chubei katho, nuoipilchung nunchan ka-eii rakip ngaikha nangni diang makheiya minthitaru. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Hiwa ngai jarra, Pathian raangna kha ama chongkajuimak mi ngaidiang ajuosik eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fq">ama chongkajuimak mi ngaidiang </char> itihi ommak.</note> <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Inmani karra ningleiomlai, nangni um aphakhat achu khawa ringkhuo khan ningleiring.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Takkha tuunchu, akaraang, mikathatzoot, miringkhat thamaknasik ka-ngaidon, mi karilse khat-um murra inphut chongkathamak karil, hiwa rakip ngaihi mathaanru.<verse eid="COL 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Akamaruo mikha anunchan le inruoiya nidajei keengnga, inkhatli inkhatdiang maleisei rilkhaimaru <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Eph 4:22</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />halli akaboolpa aramil tak-ah singna theina dungjuiya mintharna akathar mi kha ning-inlukjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Eph 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:26">Inphut 1:26</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Khawa jarra, Greek li Jihudi, wun katan li katanmak, ka-am, kamo, suok li suok ka-emak ommakjei, takkha angrakip-ah Christa om, halli Christa kha angrakip eii.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Pathian inakadang inthiang khat-um inaminriang ning-eii jarra, inriang, minriang kajet, nunchan inchuol, malung kadai khat-um kadei karaat hiwa ngaihin ningpum ngaikha insuunru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Eph 4:2</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Inkhat li inkhat inzootnaru halli miringkhat chungnga miring inkhat in kahoimak angjet ngaikha in-ngaidamru. Pumi'n nangni ina-ngaidam angnga nangni innum in-ngaidamru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Eph 4:32</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Halli hiwa ngai rakip pui katungnga kakhuopchun inriang hi neiru. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Christa diangnga kahoi kadai khan ningmalung ngaikhan wai roonrase, pumkhatbit taksa ngai ning-eii jarra nangni hi kahoi kadai sik-ak inakoi kha ning-eii. Halli nangni'n rokru.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Nangni'n lungsing lungwar rakip-ah inkhatli inkhat inchu indikru, nangni minpaak laa, rokpuina laa khat-um ratha laa khan Pathian diang ningmalung karok-ah sakru, Christa chongkha nangni diang insam omlekleiya omrase.<verse eid="COL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Halli ning-itho rakip, chuonna emakli chongnga, angrakip kha ama diangnga inphut Pa Pathian kha minpaak inlang Pumi Jisu ramingnga thoru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Eph 5:19</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:20">20</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christian Insuungkhur Sisikdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Pumi diang rahoi ka-eii angnga, inkaneijei numeisa ngai ningruothar ngai nuoiya omru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Pakhat ngai, ningnumei ngai minriangru halli inmani chungnga kese-ah thomaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Eph 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Sangai, ang rakip-ah ningnu ningpa chong juiru, ajarchu hiwahi Pumi imanuon kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Eph 6:1</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Nu li pa ngai, ningsa ngai malung kahoimak suokmanasik inmani raangnasik chuon thomaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Eph 6:4</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Suokngai, ningkaru ngai'n na-enphabit khat-um inmani'n naminriangnasik elekleiya; takkha Pumi ningchile inruoiya ningmalung kaluut-ah angrakip-ah nuoipilchungnga kaom ningkaru ngaikha juiru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Eph 6:5-8</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ning-itho rakip-ah, mi sik-ah kitho emak Pumi sik-ah kitho eii ngaidon inlang, ningmalung pumpuiya thoru. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Pumi Christa kha eii sepa nitho. Ama mi ngai sik-ah idajei chuonthoman kha Pumi diangnga inphut ningmusik eii itihi ngaidonru.<verse eid="COL 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Akadikmak akatho ama khan adikmakna kha amusik eii, ajarchu khawa khan mimeel mimai ensik ommak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Innidan 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Eph 6:9</ref></char><verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Karu ngai, katuunna khat-um katha-ah ningsuok ngaikha inliingnaru, ajarchu marwaanna nangni-um Karu om itihi ningjet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Eph 6:9</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minchu Mindikna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Inchatlekleiya Pathian niru, Pathian minpaakle inruoiya inringchakru. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Halli kei'n mikhumna ah kaomna ajarchu, chongkahoi sik-ah Pathian in lam anamalongpi nasik halli Christa inthuukna kha keini'n kinril matornasik nangni'n Pathian nanipiru. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Kei'n karilsik kasuok kha inthiarra karil nasik-ah Pathian nanipiru.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Apha kacha ningmuna rakip-ah Pathian kajetmak mi ngaidiang ningomchan minsingtheiru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Eph 5:16</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Mi rakip diang akadik-ah ningmasang theinasik ah, ningchongrilna rakip-ah minhoitheiru khat-um ra-ngaizoot minomcheiru,<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insuona Chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Minriang kaom nisap Tychicus, huoikajouwa chuonkatho khat-um einile Pumi suok ka-eii ama'n kei jarra angrakip kha nangnidiang narilpite. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Chuon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Eph 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Keini'n angtho thoa kinlaomme iti ningjetnasik khat-um ningmalung amasoknasik jarra kei'n nangnidiang ama kiheitir eii.<verse eid="COL 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Nangni mi ka-ejei, huoikajou khat-um minriang kaom nisuopui Onesimus le inruoiya ama ajuosik eii. Inmani inni'n hiwa hinna akasuok rakip ngai jarra narilpijei inte. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Philem 10-12</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Keile mikhumna ah kaomsuom Aristarchus in nangnidiang inpaakna chong najuominchoi, Barnabas tupa ka-eii Mark innum inpaakna chong najuominchoi. (Ama jarra nangni'n ningjetjei; ama'n nangnidiang ajuo inchu, ama kha leidonru.) <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Chuon 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philem 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Chuon 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Justus tia-um inkoi Joshua innum inpaakna chong najuominchoi. Jihudi ngai karra inmani inthumbit in-eii Pathian kajet khat-um keile Pathian rengram sik-ah chuonkatho, inmani'n kei kadiang akalok ah sanna innanei.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Nangni mi ka-eii khat-um Christa Jisu suok-um ka-eii Epaphras in anaminpaak. Nangni'n Pathian lungdou khan kacheet-ah ningngirnasik, akachang khat-um kacheet-ah ka-ngamna ning enasik inchatlekleiya Pathian diang ananipi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Col 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Philem 23</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Kei'n ama jarra karilmator khachu amahi nangni sik khat-um Laodicea li Hierapolis ah kaom inmani sik-ah ranak-ah chuon atho.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Minriang kaom kathiam Luke khat-um Demas inmani inni innum inpaakna chong innajuominchoi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2TI 4:11">2 Tim 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philem 24</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philem 24</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Kei inpaakna chonghi Laodicea ah akaom ule nai ngaidiang, Nympha diang halli ama inn khan inchun koisuok ngaidiang peru. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Hiwa injia chonghi nangnidiang nateelpisuo thengnga Laodicea koisuok khannum inteel kha erase halli Laodicea makheiya nahongpeii injia chongkha nangni'n teelru. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Halli Archippus kha “Pumi sik-ah thosik inpeii chuon ngaikha huui mintungnasik” tipiru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Philem 2</ref></char><verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Hiwa minpaakna hi Paul kei kakut tak-in kimajia eii. Kei thirruiya innakhuop kha ngaidonru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Riangwai kha nangni chungnga omrase.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>